From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:06:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: give the bench's plain-8k database 8 KiB pages on
 Android 9

On the G6, Android 9, every plain-8k database came out with 4096-byte
pages: Android 9 opens a new database in its compatibility WAL, which
writes the header with the default page size before the gate's pragma
runs, so the bench timed the page size it did not mean to. The A20's and
the S9's had 8 KiB. The gate now takes the database out of WAL, sets the
page size and vacuums it before WAL again, and fails the bench if the
page size is not 8 KiB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../org/mozilla/fenix/encri/EncriGateActivity.kt  | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/encri/EncriGateActivity.kt b/mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/encri/EncriGateActivity.kt
index 483ceb74cb..36c418f6d7 100644
--- a/mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/encri/EncriGateActivity.kt
+++ b/mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/encri/EncriGateActivity.kt
@@ -640,13 +640,26 @@ class EncriGateActivity : ComponentActivity() {
                             if (kind == "plain-8k") {
                                 // Made empty, in WAL mode with 8 KiB pages, which places' own pragma then cannot
                                 // change; without Android's own table, so that places takes it for a new database.
+                                // Android 9 opens a new database in its compatibility WAL, which writes the header
+                                // with the default page size before any pragma of ours: out of WAL, a vacuum makes
+                                // it again with 8 KiB pages. Any other page size fails the bench.
                                 SQLiteDatabase.openDatabase(
                                     path.path,
                                     null,
                                     SQLiteDatabase.CREATE_IF_NECESSARY or SQLiteDatabase.NO_LOCALIZED_COLLATORS,
                                 ).use { db ->
+                                    fun pragma(sql: String) =
+                                        db.rawQuery("PRAGMA $sql", null).use {
+                                            if (it.moveToFirst()) it.getString(0) else null
+                                        }
+                                    pragma("journal_mode = DELETE")
                                     db.execSQL("PRAGMA page_size = $PLACES_BENCH_SMALL_PAGE")
-                                    db.rawQuery("PRAGMA journal_mode = WAL", null).use { it.moveToFirst() }
+                                    db.execSQL("VACUUM")
+                                    pragma("journal_mode = WAL")
+                                    val page = pragma("page_size")
+                                    check(page == "$PLACES_BENCH_SMALL_PAGE") {
+                                        "plain-8k was made with $page-byte pages"
+                                    }
                                 }
                             }
                             val run = JSONObject().put("kind", kind).put("round", round).put("visits", visits)
-- 
